# 🩺 Sugar Scan

Sugar Scan is a machine learning-based diabetes risk prediction web
application.

🌐 Live Demo: https://relaxed-caramel-9c918f.netlify.app/

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 🚀 Features

-   Diabetes risk prediction using Machine Learning
-   Client-side prediction (No backend required)
-   Fast and privacy-focused
-   Simple and user-friendly interface
-   Machine learning model runs directly in the browser

------------------------------------------------------------------------

## 🧠 Machine Learning Workflow

### 1. Data Preprocessing

-   Dataset cleaning
-   Handling input features
-   Preparing data for training

### 2. Feature Standardization

All input values are standardized:

z = (x - μ) / σ

Where: - x = input value - μ = training data mean - σ = standard
deviation

### 3. Model Training

Dataset is divided using stratified splitting:

80% Training Data\
20% Testing Data

### 4. Model Export

Trained model parameters are exported using:

export_model.py

Generated file:

public/model.json

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 📊 Model Evaluation

Sugar Scan evaluates machine learning models using:

## Accuracy

Measures overall prediction correctness.

## Precision

Measures how many predicted diabetic cases are actually diabetic.

Precision = TP / (TP + FP)

## Recall

Measures how many actual diabetic cases were detected.

Recall = TP / (TP + FN)

## F1 Score

Balances precision and recall.

F1 = 2 × (Precision × Recall) / (Precision + Recall)

## Confusion Matrix

Shows: - True Positive - True Negative - False Positive - False Negative

