# 📦 Installation

## Requirements

Install: - Node.js - npm - Python 3.x

## Clone Repository

``` bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/sugar-scan.git
cd sugar-scan
```

## Install Dependencies

``` bash
npm install
```

## Run Application

``` bash
npm run dev
```

Open:

http://localhost:5173

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 🔄 Retrain Machine Learning Model

Run:

``` bash
python export_model.py
```

Generated:

public/model.json

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 🏭 Production Build

``` bash
npm run build
```

Output:

dist/

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 🔒 Privacy Design

Sugar Scan follows a privacy-first architecture.

Features:

✅ Prediction happens in the browser\
✅ No patient data upload\
✅ No database storage\
✅ No cloud API dependency

